{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF16"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"decode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"input","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF16O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt16V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s21UnicodeDecodingResultO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnicodeDecodingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"IteratorProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:St","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:St7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol\/Element"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt16","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt16V","text":"UInt16","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"input","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An iterator of code units to be decoded. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"input"},{"type":"text","text":" must be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the same iterator instance in repeated calls to this method. Do not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"advance the iterator or any copies of the iterator outside this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"method.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"text":" instance, representing the next","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"until it returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput"},{"type":"text","text":". Checking that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffered data from the input iterator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"in the iterator for a given returned "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unicode.Scalar"},{"type":"text","text":" or an error."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example decodes the UTF-16 encoded bytes of a string into an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unicode.Scalar"},{"text":" instances. This is a demonstration only—if","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unicodeScalars"},{"text":" view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let str = \"✨Unicode✨\"","print(Array(str.utf16))","\/\/ Prints \"[10024, 85, 110, 105, 99, 111, 100, 101, 10024]\"","","var codeUnitIterator = str.utf16.makeIterator()","var scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = []","var utf16Decoder = UTF16()","Decode: while true {","    switch utf16Decoder.decode(&codeUnitIterator) {","    case .scalarValue(let v): scalars.append(v)","    case .emptyInput: break Decode","    case .error:","        print(\"Decoding error\")","        break Decode","    }","}","print(scalars)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"\\u{2728}\", \"U\", \"n\", \"i\", \"c\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"\\u{2728}\"]\""]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/utf16\/decode(_:)-swift.method"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF16\/decode(_:)-swift.method","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Swift","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"externalID":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF16O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt16V7ElementRtzlF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"decode"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF16O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt16V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier",